---
import Platform from '../layouts/Platform.astro';
import CarouselReader from '../components/CarouselReader.astro';
import {foundingPass,readingPreview} from '../data/founding-pass.mjs';
import '../styles/founding-pass.css';
import '../styles/carousel-library.css';
---
<Platform title="Founding Member Pass" description="Full Digivated carousels, practical examples, and useful references. The Founding Member Pass is $2 once for the first 25 purchases.">
  <header class="page-intro founding-intro"><p class="eyebrow">The full idea, beyond the post</p><h1>Keep learning after the last slide.</h1><p class="lede">Digivated's X posts introduce the idea. The founding collection continues with full carousels, clear examples, and useful references you can come back to. The collection grows as carousels are added.</p><div class="founding-price"><strong>{foundingPass.priceUSD} USD</strong><span>One-time founding price · First {foundingPass.introductoryLimit} passes</span></div><p class="founding-launch-state"><span class="founding-status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Available now. One payment for permanent access to this collection.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href={foundingPass.checkoutUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get the Founding Member Pass</a><a class="button" href="#member-sign-in">Already purchased? Sign in</a></div><p class="quiet"><a href="https://x.com/digivatedx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read Digivated on X ↗</a></p><p class="quiet founding-price-note">The $2 offer is for the first 25 purchases. It is not a subscription. Applicable taxes are shown at Gumroad checkout. The UI/UX Prompt Packet is a separate product.</p></header>
  <section class="founding-section" aria-labelledby="pass-includes"><p class="eyebrow">A small collection, explained properly</p><h2 id="pass-includes">What the founding pass includes</h2><div class="founding-benefits"><article><span class="founding-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span><h3>The complete carousels</h3><p>Follow the explanation beyond the public preview. Each carousel has one clear objective and a sensible reading order.</p></article><article><span class="founding-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><h3>Examples you can use</h3><p>See how the idea works in a realistic situation, with a practical next step that fits the topic.</p></article><article><span class="founding-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3>References with a purpose</h3><p>Find sources and further reading, with enough context to understand why each link is useful.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="founding-section" id="reading-preview" aria-labelledby="reading-preview-title"><p class="eyebrow">Made for a phone. Comfortable to read.</p><h2 id="reading-preview-title">One idea at a time.</h2><p>Swipe through the cards, use the arrows, or open the text version below. You control the pace.</p><CarouselReader slides={readingPreview}/></section>
  <section class="founding-section founding-inventory" aria-labelledby="founding-collection-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">The founding collection</p><h2 id="founding-collection-title">Carousels in this collection</h2><p>The collection is growing. Titles appear here as carousels are added. The first four slides of each carousel stay open to everyone.</p></div><div class="founding-inventory-state"><strong>Collection growing</strong><p id="founding-inventory-empty">There are no member carousels available yet.</p><ul id="founding-inventory-list" class="founding-inventory-list" hidden></ul><a href="/resources">Explore the available UI/UX packet →</a></div></section>
  <section class="founding-section" id="member-sign-in" aria-labelledby="member-sign-in-title"><h2 id="member-sign-in-title">Already purchased?</h2><p>Sign in with the license key or the email from your Gumroad receipt. A Prompt Packet license does not open this collection.</p><form id="founding-access-form" class="carousel-access" method="post" action="/api/founding-access"><label>Gumroad license key<input name="license" type="password" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="characters" spellcheck="false" maxlength="35"/></label><p class="quiet">or</p><label>Purchase email<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254"/></label><button class="button primary" type="submit">Sign in</button><p id="founding-access-status" role="status"></p></form><button class="button" id="founding-sign-out" type="button" hidden>Sign out of founding access</button></section>
  <section class="founding-section founding-terms" aria-labelledby="founding-pass-terms"><h2 id="founding-pass-terms">One payment. A clearly defined collection.</h2><dl><div><dt>What you keep</dt><dd>Permanent access to the founding collection of full carousels. It is not a monthly subscription, and there are no automatic renewals. The collection grows as carousels are added.</dd></div><div><dt>Later releases</dt><dd>Future collections are not automatically included. Each new offer explains its own contents and price.</dd></div><div><dt>The first 25 passes</dt><dd>The introductory price is $2 USD for the first 25 purchases. After that, the founding offer closes. A later offer may have a different price.</dd></div><div><dt>The UI/UX Prompt Packet</dt><dd>The $4 packet is a separate product. Buying the founding pass does not unlock the packet, and packet purchases do not unlock this collection.</dd></div></dl></section>

  <script>import '../scripts/carousel-reader.js';</script>
  <script>import '../scripts/carousel-library.js';</script>
</Platform>
